            title: "Chemical Reactor",
            icon: "arcforge:chemical_reactor",
            description: [
                "Hardened Alloy, glass, Hardened Fluid Tanks, nickel plates and a thermocouple: three item and three fluid inputs. Acids, leaching and precipitating, plastics, fertilizer, lithium and every step of uranium chemistry run through it. Its recipes are tagged general, leaching or precipitating.",
                "",
                "**Covers:** {item:arcforge:chemical_reactor}"
            ],
            x: 0d,
            y: 2.5d,
            shape: "hexagon",
