            title: "Sulfuric Acid",
            icon: "arcforge:sulfuric_acid_bucket",
            description: [
                "One Sulfur Dust and 500 mB of water make 500 mB of Sulfuric Acid. It leaches ore, dissolves spodumene into Lithium Brine, makes Hydrofluoric Acid with Fluorite Dust and catalyses Ethylene from Ethanol.",
                "",
                "**Covers:** {item:arcforge:sulfuric_acid_bucket}"
